    {
      "id": "3d8841ae-3adc-4016-a83d-dec93a4c942b",
      "phaseId": "68a01ad8-1026-4c09-b516-2e2838723903",
      "number": 275,
      "shortId": "HET4A",
      "priority": 2,
      "shortName": "compose-leaf-widgets",
      "title": "viewnode-task-2: Compose leaf widgets (Button first)",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "Compose the leaf widgets so content = child `Component`s, not hand-drawn in `paint`. `Button` + `Item`. Unblocks `button-shortcut`.\n\n## STATUS: code complete on branch `feat/viewnode-button-composition` (off `feat/base-focusable`). AWAITING USER TEST → then rust-skill review → commit/PR.\n\n## DESIGN LOCKED (grill-me 2026-07-13 with user — do NOT re-derive)\n- **Children, not slots.** `Button` holds `children: Vec<Box<dyn Component>>` — arbitrary tree, any depth. `Parent` (`.child`), plus `.content_boxed(Box<dyn Component>)` for a `realize`d subtree (`Dialog::body_boxed` precedent). The `label` field is GONE.\n- **Sugar desugars into children at build time** (no second paint path): `Button::new(\"X\")` -> `[Label bold]`; `.icon(g)` -> prepends `[Icon, Label]`; `Button::empty()` -> compose freely. ViewNode precedence: **children win**; `text`/`icon` props build the sugar only when childless.\n- **Widget stops computing size; taffy measures.** `width`/`height` = `Auto`; `padding_x = BASE_PAD*pad_scale + fs*MONO_ADVANCE_RATIO` (one char/side), `padding_y = BASE_PAD*pad_scale`, `gap = fs*0.5`. Exact parity with the old `(chars+2)*fs*ratio + pad*2`.\n- **Per-state content color = ONE inherited `Color`** via `PaintCx::with_content_color`. Parent can't set child colors (children are `impl Component`; `Theme` only exists in `paint`), so it publishes one value per frame and unstyled `Label`/`Icon` pull it -> content animates with hover / fades when disabled, zero per-child wiring. Explicit `.color()` and intrinsic-color widgets (`Badge::danger`) win.\n- **One control = one Tab stop**: `Base.focus_barrier` stops focus descent (`focus.rs` `for_each_focusable`). Set by `Button` + `Item`.\n- **Size variant now INHERITS down the tree** (approved library change) — the missing piece that made composition actually work.\n\n## IMPLEMENTED (all gates green)\n**Foundations (heca-grid-ui):**\n- `style.rs`: `Style.size_explicit: bool` + `Style::set_size()` (the single place explicitness is recorded).\n- `builders.rs`: `LayoutExt::size` -> `set_size`.\n- `layout.rs`: `build(c, inherited_size)` — a node without an explicit variant adopts its parent's; effective variant written back to `style.size` and passed to children. `compute()` seeds `WidgetSize::default()`.\n- `component.rs`: `Base.focus_barrier`; `PaintCx.content_color` + `with_content_color()` + `content_color()`.\n- `focus.rs`: `for_each_focusable` does not descend past a `focus_barrier`.\n- `label.rs`: color falls back to `cx.content_color()`; **`bold` is now `Signal<bool>`** + `bold_signal()` (Item's bold is state-driven; the inherited context carries only color).\n- `icon.rs`: primary color falls back to `cx.content_color()`.\n- `icon_button.rs`: dropped its manual size-cascade hack (the engine inherits it now).\n\n**Button (`widgets/button.rs`)**: `empty()` / `new(label)` / `.icon(Glyph)` / `.content_boxed()` / `Parent`; `remeasure` hugs content; `paint_content()` publishes the state color and paints children; `Link` underline now spans the real content box (no char-count fake); `tick` recurses into children; `focus_barrier`.\n\n**Item (`widgets/item.rs`)**: label is a real `Label` child (`grow(1)`, `TextAlign::Start`) at index `LABEL=1` between the slots; `justify: Start` + `gap`; state color published via `with_content_color`; active-bold driven through the label's `bold_signal()` in `tick` (only on real change); `font_size` cascades to the label child; `focus_barrier`; `label_rect()` deleted.\n\n**realize (`heca/src/chrome/realize.rs`)**: `realize_button` **attaches `node.children`** (it silently DROPPED them before — a declarative `Button(Icon+Label)` rendered bare) + children-win precedence + `icon` prop sugar; added `\"trash\"` to `glyph_from_name` (curated map was missing it).\n\n**Docs**: `AGENTS.md` — new rule: widget docs must be EXHAUSTIVE with runnable examples for BOTH audiences (native builder + `ViewNode`), incl. precedence rules. `docs/widgets.md` — Button rewritten (both audiences), Item, `Base.focus_barrier`, `PaintCx::with_content_color`/`content_color`, size-variant cascade. Showcase — new \"Button — composed content\" row (icon sugar, disabled cluster, arbitrary tree, size cascade).\n\n**Tests (+8)**: grid-ui `phase_a.rs` — sugar-desugars-to-children; hugs-content-at-historical-size (width/height parity); grows-to-fit-composed-content; size-variant-cascades-to-content (+ explicit child wins); composed-content-inherits-state-color (+ explicit color wins, disabled fades); a-button-is-one-tab-stop-whatever-it-contains. heca `realize.rs` — button-children-are-realized; childless-button-uses-sugar.\n\n## GATES (2026-07-13)\n`cargo test`: heca-grid-ui 130 + 71 + 1, heca 335, workspace 759 passed / 0 failed. `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features`: clean (only the pre-existing transitive `block v0.1.6` future-incompat note). Showcase builds. NOTE: `heca-core::terminal_backend_nvim_tui_produces_non_default_background_cells` flaked once under workspace-parallel load — passes 3/3 in isolation and the diff touches ZERO heca-core files (known PTY-timing flakiness, same class as the ones BACKLOG documents).\n\n## REMAINING\n1. **User runtime test** (AGENTS.md gate: no commit until the user has tested): `cargo run -p heca-renderer --example showcase` (hover/disable the composed buttons; check the size cascade) and `cargo run -p heca` (confirm dialog buttons, sidebar rows).\n2. Load `~/.agents/skills/rust/SKILL.md` and run the formal review over the diff.\n3. Commit + PR to `main`.\n4. Follow-on (separate task): `Item`'s `ViewNode` children/slots are still unmodelled (needs structured/named children — `viewnode-task-1` territory); `realize` coverage for `Select`/`Tabs`/`Grid`/`ItemGroup`/`DockFrame`/`MarkerGroup`/`ScrollBar`/`Toast` remains open.\n\n---\n**Completion summary:**\nDONE 2026-07-13 — commit `07d4c1a` on `feat/viewnode-button-composition`, **PR #237 → main** (open). User tested showcase + app and ran the review; one review nit applied (GAP_RATIO rationale) before push.\n\n## Shipped\n**Button is a container** (`heca-grid-ui/src/widgets/button.rs`): `label` field removed; content = `children` (arbitrary tree, any depth). `Button::empty()` / `new(label)` / `.icon(Glyph)` / `.content_boxed(Box<dyn Component>)` / `impl Parent`. Sugar desugars into children at build time — one content model, one paint path. `remeasure` hugs content (`width`/`height` = Auto; `padding_x = BASE_PAD*pad_scale + fs*MONO_ADVANCE_RATIO`, `padding_y = BASE_PAD*pad_scale`, `gap = fs*0.5`) at **exact parity** with the old `(chars+2)*fs*ratio + pad*2`. `paint_content()` publishes the state color; `Link` underline spans the real content box; `tick` recurses into children; `focus_barrier`.\n\n**Item** (`widgets/item.rs`): label is a real `Label` child (`grow(1)`, `TextAlign::Start`) at index `LABEL=1`; `justify: Start` + gap; state color via `with_content_color`; active-bold via the label's `bold_signal()` in `tick`; `font_size` cascades to the child; `focus_barrier`; `label_rect()` deleted.\n\n**Foundations (heca-grid-ui):**\n- `component.rs`: `Base.focus_barrier`; `PaintCx::with_content_color()` / `content_color()` (CSS-style color inheritance — the parent can't set child colors: children are `impl Component` and `Theme` only exists in `paint`).\n- `focus.rs`: `for_each_focusable` does not descend past a `focus_barrier` → a control is exactly one Tab stop (was: focusable-but-click-dead children).\n- `layout.rs`: `build(c, inherited_size)` — **size variant now inherits down the tree** like the base font; effective variant written back to `style.size` and passed to children.\n- `style.rs`: `Style.size_explicit` + `Style::set_size()` (single place explicitness is recorded — a raw `style.size = ..` is NOT explicit).\n- `builders.rs`: `LayoutExt::size` → `set_size`.\n- `label.rs`: color falls back to `cx.content_color()`; **`bold` is now `Signal<bool>`** + `bold_signal()`.\n- `icon.rs`: primary color falls back to `cx.content_color()`.\n- `icon_button.rs`: manual size-cascade hack **deleted** (engine inherits it now).\n\n**realize** (`heca/src/chrome/realize.rs`): `realize_button` **attaches `node.children`** (it silently DROPPED them before — the declarative path was a no-op for composed content); children-win precedence; `icon` prop sugar; `\"trash\"` added to `glyph_from_name`.\n\n**Docs**: AGENTS.md — widget docs must be EXHAUSTIVE with runnable examples for BOTH audiences (native builder + `ViewNode`) incl. precedence rules. `docs/widgets.md` — Button (both audiences), Item, `Base.focus_barrier`, `PaintCx::with_content_color`, size cascade. Showcase — \"Button — composed content\" row.\n\n**Tests +8** (grid-ui `phase_a.rs` ×6, heca `realize.rs` ×2): size parity; growth with composed content; size cascade + explicit child wins; inherited state color + explicit color wins + disabled fades; one Tab stop with an interactive child inside; sugar-desugars-to-children; realize attaches Button children; childless node uses sugar.\n\n**Gates**: heca-grid-ui 130+71+1, heca 335, workspace 759 passed / 0 failed, clippy clean (only pre-existing transitive `block v0.1.6` note).\n\n## Follow-ons (not in this task)\n- `Item`'s `ViewNode` children/slots are still unmodelled (needs structured/named children — belongs with `viewnode-task-1`).\n- `realize` coverage for `Select`/`Tabs`/`Grid`/`ItemGroup`/`DockFrame`/`MarkerGroup`/`ScrollBar`/`Toast` remains open (`viewnode-task-1`).\n- Button accelerator (`button-shortcut` phase) is now UNBLOCKED on the Button side; still needs NerdFont embedding (`gridui-03`).",
